{"id":8802331,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-transformer/merge_requests/7837","number":7837,"state":"merged","title":"[mc2] fix matmul_all_reduce pertensor量化和3rd/quant_batch_matmul_v3不匹配的问题","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-transformer/pulls/7837","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-transformer/pulls/7837/issues","body":"## 描述\n<!--在这里详细描述你的改动，包括改动的原因和所采取的方法。-->\n对于perchannel场景，如果n=1，那么scale=(1,1)/(1);quant_batch_matmul_v3针对这种场景统一判定为pertensor量化；\n而mc2针对(1,1)判定为perchannel量化，导致tiling和matmul tiling不匹配，产生精度问题\n\n## 关联的Issue\n<!-- 如果这个PR是为了解决特定的Issue，请在这里提供Issue链接。例如：关联Issue #000-->\n<!-- 如果这个PR是为了解决特定的问题单，请在这里描述问题单单号。-->\n\n## 测试\n<!--描述进行了哪些测试来验证你的改动。包括但不限于二级冒烟、算子泛化等。-->\n\n## 文档更新\n<!--如果这个PR包含文档的更新，请在这里指出。例如：更新了README.md文件。-->\n\n## 类型标签\n<!--  [x] 表示选中 -->\n- [x] \uD83D\uDC1B Bug修复\n- [ ] ✨ 新特性\n- [ ] ⚡ 性能优化\n- [ ] ♻️ 重构\n- [ ] \uD83E\uDDEA 测试\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDCE6 构建/CI\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDD27 配置变更\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDCDD 文档更新\n- [ ] ⬆️ 依赖升级\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDD12 安全修复\n- [ ] \uD83E\uDDF9 代码清理\n- [ ] ❓ 其他，请描述：\n\n代码检视报告\n检视提交：cec9c8b4c - fix matmul_all_reduce pertensor量化和3rd/quant_batch_matmul_v3不匹配的问题\n统计项\t数值\nMEDIUM\t1\nISSUE-001 | MEDIUM | 错误消息与逻辑语义不一致\n文件：matmul_all_reduce_tiling_base.cpp:596-599 + CheckDequantScaleShape 错误消息\n风险：base 类 IsPerTensorDequantScale 只认 1D [1]，但 CheckDequantScaleShape 错误消息提到 [1,n] 作为合法 per-tensor shape，两者语义矛盾。arch22/31 场景下 2D [1,1] 会被误判为 per-channel。\n建议：存疑项。确认 arch22/31 是否支持 2D per-tensor scale 输入——若不支持，更新错误消息；若支持，需统一为 last-dim 判断。","assignees_number":0,"assignees":[],"testers":[],"approval_reviewers":[],"labels":[{"id":4929,"color":"#2865E0","name":"cann-cla/yes","repository_id":7673863,"created_at":"2025-06-21T10:53:09+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-29T20:25:34+08:00"},{"id":22553,"color":"#3ee029","name":"api-check-pass","repository_id":7673863,"created_at":"2025-12-16T09:45:21+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-30T17:27:06+08:00"},{"id":3873,"color":"#21BA45","name":"ci-pipeline-passed","repositor